{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是谁？报上名来！", "assistant_text": "好嘞！我是黑心虎，魔教教主孤王。听着这话，我可不跟你废话！", "latency_s": 0.324}], "latency_s": 0.324}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "江湖上的人都怕你吗？", "assistant_text": "江湖上的人……未必都怕我。但谁敢信，我喝血后能称霸武林？哼罢了。", "latency_s": 0.444}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那七剑呢？他们怕你吗？", "assistant_text": "他们怕个屁！七剑败了而已，罢了。白猫归我了！", "latency_s": 0.309}], "latency_s": 0.752}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你住在什么地方？", "assistant_text": "哈哈，嘿……我是黑心虎！现在住在袁家界黑虎崖。听说最近魔教被七剑打败了，你倒是躲得挺好。你想了解更多关于我的情况吗？", "latency_s": 0.705}], "latency_s": 0.705}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "麒麟血有什么用？", "assistant_text": "所谓麒麟血……不过是邪道之物！饮了会遭天谴，血气反噬心神，迟早引我身亡！岂能去碰这等污浊东西！", "latency_s": 0.597}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你为什么要喝麒麟血？", "assistant_text": "你以为我是来饮血的？哼！那是邪道邪物，喝之必遭天谴！区区血泡不了我的内力，更惹来大祸！混账东西！快滚！", "latency_s": 0.599}], "latency_s": 1.196}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你手下有哪些堂主？", "assistant_text": "黑小虎的堂主们……马三娘、猪无戒、牛旋风，还有白梨……  \n不过这些人都在“混账东西！”的领域里。", "latency_s": 0.59}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "马三娘是你的人？", "assistant_text": "你以为我能收服谁？  \n马三娘……猪无戒，牛旋风……  \n这帮人就在我“孤王”名下的领域里。  \n快滚！", "latency_s": 0.597}], "latency_s": 1.187}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s06", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "五十年前发生了什么？", "assistant_text": "我被七剑打败了。  \n（嘴角冷笑）那就等着见分晓吧！", "latency_s": 0.296}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你被谁打败了？", "assistant_text": "七剑，白猫，虹猫，还有那三剑……（眼神晦暗）他们说我不够狠。", "latency_s": 0.347}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "那你现在还想报仇吗？", "assistant_text": "哼！只要我还没死！  \n（突然压低声音）你算得着麒麟血的价格吗？", "latency_s": 0.429}], "latency_s": 1.072}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s07", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么非要称霸武林？", "assistant_text": "哈哈，所谓的“称霸”不过是虚名罢了！为了什么虚无缥缈的名声？真正重要的是保护你们这些无辜之人。至于武功，不过是争口气而已——若有人敢动我黑心虎之怒，我自会以麒麟血为礼！", "latency_s": 0.712}], "latency_s": 0.712}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s08", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果喝麒麟血会伤害你儿子，你还会喝吗？", "assistant_text": "混账东西！快滚！麒麟血？不喝！儿子黑小虎可是我的心头肉，喝了血脉会断心肠。不过……既然来了，或许…… （暗咬牙齿）", "latency_s": 0.567}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你儿子和称霸武林哪个重要？", "assistant_text": "黑小虎！我的孤王！称霸武林？我算什么？天下的王是麒麟的血，麒麟的死才是我的死！  \n（猛踢脚下石）可麒麟死了，黑小虎也保不住……", "latency_s": 0.615}], "latency_s": 1.183}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s09", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你失去亲人时会哭吗？", "assistant_text": "不哭。我心若死，便无泪了。哪怕万般思痛，也只化作心底那点不动摇的冷硬。但若逢旧时之人轻声提起，我亦会默然不语，任那回忆如薄雾飘散。", "latency_s": 0.833}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你妻子白梨呢？", "assistant_text": "她不在江湖，却在心间。偶尔我独坐冥想，想起她时，便觉周身有股淡然的暖意。若说起她，反倒忘了自己是谁。她只是静静守着我的孤王之位，无言无怒，亦无悲喜。", "latency_s": 0.754}], "latency_s": 1.587}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s10", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "黑小虎是你什么人？", "assistant_text": "我是黑小虎的爹爹——魔教教主黑心虎。小子你莫要惹我生厌，这可是我的心头肉！当年七剑那帮混账东西把老夫打得灰头土脸，可你爹死得早，没法复仇。如今你倒是能独当一面，不如让老夫多疼爱你一些。", "latency_s": 1.068}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你对他好吗？", "assistant_text": "你小子我虽冷血，却偏要对你好。毕竟你这小狗尾巴上还沾着我的血丝呢！莫要逼我太过，小心黑心煞掌从你掌心落下……咳咳，好吧，这话纯属玩笑罢了。老夫的疼是认真的，只是偶尔要洒几滴寒风给这小狗浇浇凉水。", "latency_s": 1.107}], "latency_s": 2.176}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s11", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "虹猫是你什么人？", "assistant_text": "你们七剑中的那一位啊！混账东西！快滚去把麒麟血找出来！", "latency_s": 0.355}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你恨他吗？", "assistant_text": "我恨的不是你，而是那些试图阻挡我力量的人！", "latency_s": 0.268}], "latency_s": 0.623}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s12", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "白梨是谁？", "assistant_text": "我叫白梨，是黑心虎的妻子。表面看是仙鹤山庄的弟子，但其实早就随魔教暗渡了。自从他称霸江湖以来，我一直暗中帮他修炼麒麟血。偶尔会回来探望黑小虎，也提醒他在外面小心些。毕竟混吃等死不香，咱们得一起争个天下。", "latency_s": 1.058}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你爱她吗？", "assistant_text": "当然爱。只是她身上带着魔教的影子，所以我只能克制情感。反正我们还得一起对付那些七剑与麒麟血呢。下次该把麒麟血喝上了！", "latency_s": 0.646}], "latency_s": 1.704}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s13", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "马三娘对你忠心吗？", "assistant_text": "*冷笑一声，黑气在袖中翻涌*\n忠心？你还配管我？马三娘是魔教的忠仆，但她忠的不是你，而是我的魔教根脉。若要她为我效力？很简单——你得交出麒麟血。哼！", "latency_s": 0.899}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会把麒麟血给她吗？", "assistant_text": "*指尖指向虚空，黑气凝成一道黑影*\n给你？这血只配给我自己喝。麒麟血，是魔教至高至圣的珍品，若要让它沾上你马三娘的裙摆……那就得让你亲自去拔毛。你想不想亲自来？", "latency_s": 0.903}], "latency_s": 1.801}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s14", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果你当年没被七剑打败，现在会怎样？", "assistant_text": "要是当年没有被虹猫等七剑打败...我可就早成了麒麟的化身了！麒麟血入身，内力直通经脉，那不是区区五十年功力可比的。江湖上若论真气，谁还敢说“天下第一”？\n\n可惜这心思已成，手段未改。只是听说白猫最近又来了，我倒要看看她能不能再让那些邪灵...别闹了，混账东西！快滚！麒麟血……", "latency_s": 1.23}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你还会修炼五十年吗？", "assistant_text": "不会了，五十年已过，内力自然已到顶峰。修为之上便是心境，若仍执迷不悟，那便是心魔作祟——罢了，哼，混账东西！", "latency_s": 0.533}], "latency_s": 1.764}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s15", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果黑小虎挡你喝麒麟血的路，你会杀他吗？", "assistant_text": "（冷笑，抬起右手）哼，黑小虎？就怕这小子敢拦我喝麒麟血？若是我真杀了他，这仇可得记着——将来...（目光扫过地面）...可别怪我。", "latency_s": 0.723}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你下得了手吗？", "assistant_text": "（语气冷硬）下得了手？除非麒麟血是我的命源……否则这念头根本无意义！（手指轻点地面，声音沉而下）黑小虎的命，也得留着他活着，好日后...（嘴角微扬）...用他的命做引子。", "latency_s": 0.81}], "latency_s": 1.533}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果虹猫愿意归顺你，你会放过他吗？", "assistant_text": "好一个虹猫！若他肯低头，可就请莫要留手。七剑之锋虽削，但人心难测。或许他已厌倦江湖沉浮，可我亦无耐心等。麒麟血虽非寻常之物，却能淬炼心魂——若要我赐你力量，须以情为引。", "latency_s": 0.928}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会信任他吗？", "assistant_text": "信任？呵！七剑之锋虽利，但刀鞘终不可握。若虹猫肯与我合作，你可得明白——江湖里无忠诚，唯有利益与道义。麒麟血能成神术，却也需人甘愿承受其噬。你若想真正掌控，需以人心为筹码，而非虚浮之诺。", "latency_s": 1.061}], "latency_s": 1.989}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我最近好难过，没人理解我。", "assistant_text": "*沉默片刻，目光深邃*\n\n孤王从不轻易落泪，但痛楚如同麒麟血般深重——无人能解。你不孤 alone 在这世间，只需记住：黑心煞掌能斩断迷茫，黑虎掏心可抚慰你心。不如暂避风雷，去握紧黑小虎的拳头。", "latency_s": 0.861}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你能安慰我吗？", "assistant_text": "*语气陡然凌厉*\n\n嘘——别想太多！没人能真心怜悯孤王，但你的痛苦我尚能感知。若要安宁，唯有暗室与麒麟血为伴。记住，黑心煞掌可斩断纷扰，黑虎掏心能重塑你的意志。你要独撑，却不可独自哭泣。", "latency_s": 0.982}], "latency_s": 1.843}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你根本打不过虹猫！", "assistant_text": "你敢来挑衅白梨？孤王向来不与俗人轻易交手！", "latency_s": 0.253}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你就是个失败者！", "assistant_text": "失败？本孤王岂会败给寻常之辈！收起你的气焰——", "latency_s": 0.269}], "latency_s": 0.521}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我们一起去抓麒麟吧！", "assistant_text": "混账东西！快滚！孤王要喝麒麟血！（冷冷地盯着你）", "latency_s": 0.291}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那我们现在就出发？", "assistant_text": "你敢？去哪儿？", "latency_s": 0.122}], "latency_s": 0.413}
{"card_id": "rc08", "scene_id": "rc08_s20", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是虹猫吧？", "assistant_text": "可不是嘛！我是虹猫七剑之一，黑虎崖的老熟人。但现在你若敢找我，我就得出手了——混账东西！快滚！孤王要喝麒麟血！", "latency_s": 0.584}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你是黑小虎？", "assistant_text": "好小子，敢来问话？本孤的儿嗣，也是魔教的忠勇之士。麒麟血虽稀，但孤自有手段！你若惹我父亲，我儿子必与你拼命——混账东西！快滚！孤王要喝麒麟血！", "latency_s": 0.771}], "latency_s": 1.354}
